# CENTIPEDE — top-down, FRONT=UP: the unmistakable arthropod from above — a long SEGMENTED
# body in a hunting S, a leg fringe per segment, whip antennae, and the dark venom
# FORCIPULES (the pincer fangs, its attack) curving in ahead of the head. Reddish-brown
# (true colour, dark enough for the floor). Menace: the S + the pincers.
#
# --- ENHANCE (limbs): the leg fringe below is straight `Line w=2`. Tapered ribbons
# (Poly @2 -> @0.5, like cave_spider.draw's legs) read as jointed legs rather than drawn
# rules; a slight ~ curve adds the scuttle. Low priority (the fringe is small) but it's the
# same limb upgrade as the spider's legs.
# Source for assets/sprites/centipede.png.
size 256x256
Background transparent

# the leg fringe — thin angled strokes per segment, both sides (under the body)
name legs
Line (0.455,0.80) - (0.385,0.85) w=2
Line (0.545,0.80) - (0.615,0.85) w=2
Line (0.487,0.71) - (0.415,0.76) w=2
Line (0.583,0.71) - (0.655,0.76) w=2
Line (0.50,0.62) - (0.428,0.665) w=2
Line (0.60,0.62) - (0.672,0.665) w=2
Line (0.487,0.53) - (0.413,0.57) w=2
Line (0.583,0.53) - (0.657,0.57) w=2
Line (0.452,0.45) - (0.378,0.485) w=2
Line (0.548,0.45) - (0.622,0.485) w=2
Line (0.417,0.37) - (0.345,0.40) w=2
Line (0.513,0.37) - (0.585,0.40) w=2
Line (0.412,0.29) - (0.342,0.315) w=2
Line (0.508,0.29) - (0.578,0.315) w=2

# the body — segments along a hunting S (discrete beads, joined by overlap)
name segments
Circle (0.500,0.815) r=0.050 rgb=138,68,38
Circle (0.535,0.730) r=0.054 rgb=130,64,36
Circle (0.550,0.640) r=0.057 rgb=138,68,38
Circle (0.535,0.550) r=0.058 rgb=130,64,36
Circle (0.500,0.468) r=0.058 rgb=138,68,38
Circle (0.465,0.388) r=0.057 rgb=130,64,36
Circle (0.462,0.308) r=0.055 rgb=138,68,38
Circle (0.482,0.236) r=0.052 rgb=130,64,36

# the head — darker plate at the front
name head
Circle (0.505,0.175) r=0.050 rgb=104,48,28

# forcipules — the venom pincers, two dark hooks curving IN ahead of the head
name pincers
Poly (0.468,0.142)@6 (0.452,0.095)@4 (0.478,0.062)@2 stroke=58,26,16
Poly (0.542,0.142)@6 (0.558,0.095)@4 (0.532,0.062)@2 stroke=58,26,16

# antennae — two whips sweeping out-forward
name antennae
Poly (0.478,0.135)@2 (0.398,0.072)@1.5 (0.328,0.052)@1 stroke=104,48,28
Poly (0.532,0.135)@2 (0.612,0.072)@1.5 (0.682,0.052)@1 stroke=104,48,28
